<title>INDIA: Indian Shipping -- Goa cargoes - March 10.</title>
<headline>Indian Shipping -- Goa cargoes - March 10.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the berthing schedule of major vessels loading and unloading at India's Marmagao port on March 10:</p>
<p> Commodity		Tons		   Ship	    Berthing</p>
<p>		    (LDD/ULD)(Balance)</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Iron Ore	 61,372 (LDD)    628	Maersk Sembawang  9/03</p>
<p>Molasses	  2,506 (LDD)  3,001	New Star	    9/03</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>		  Note:</p>
<p>	    LDD - Loading</p>
<p>	    ULD - Unloading</p>
